<title>USA: Brunswick Corp may issue $250 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Brunswick Corp may issue $250 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brunswick Corp is expected to issue a $250 million debt offering via lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co, syndicate sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to consist of a 10-year maturity with price talk seen at a spread of 62.5 basis points over comparable U.S. Treasuries, sources added.</p>
<p>No further details were available on the deal.</p>
<p>--Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675</p>
</text>
